Exact luck tuning matters as well.  Keeping a count of
clovers and tracking every other method of changing
luck can bring the odds up to 1-in-6 per altar prayer.
It is *extremely* easy to get the count wrong but
having a target luck value and trying to hit it works
better than just maxing out your luck.

> Polypiling.  But note that every time you poly a spellbook its
